Chapter: MutLaunderListReturn

 A callee that hands the mutable record onward inside a List return
 consumes it; handing the same record to two such owners on one path
 is aliasing.

Section: Definitions

  mutable Counter = record {
   value : Integer
  }

  stash-list : Counter -> List Counter
  stash-list (c) = [c]

  double-stash : Counter -> Integer
  double-stash (m) =
   let a = stash-list m
   in let b = stash-list m
   in 0

  opening : Text = show (double-stash (Counter { value = 21 }))
